### Smoke test (manual)
1. `pnpm start` — Gotenberg container healthy on :3001 (verified via `docker ps`).
2. `curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/api/pdf-render/from-template/<id> -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{}' -o test.pdf` — returns `application/pdf` stream.
3. Open `test.pdf` — Cyrillic text renders correctly, A4 portrait.

